<title>INDONESIA: Citra Marga 9-mth net up.</title>
<headline>Citra Marga 9-mth net up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September</p>
<p>			  (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Toll revenues		   154.44  vs  108.69</p>
<p>    Operating profit		100.70  vs   85.73</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  110.07  vs   83.21</p>
<p>    Net profit			 93.21  vs   66.70</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)    151  vs     171</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	     179.69  vs   92.79</p>
<p>Note : The results were audited. PT Citra Marga Nusaphala Persada is Indonesia's toll-road builder and operator.</p>
</text>
